# ==============================================================================
# INVCRAFT MEDIA – CENTRAL ROUTING CONFIGURATION (Cloudflare Pages)
# ==============================================================================
# Format:
#   <source-path>  <target-path>  <status-code>
#
# Rules:
# 1. 200 = Internal Proxy Rewrite (clean URL shown to user without URL change)
# 2. 301 = Permanent Redirect (ensures trailing slashes for directory resolution)
# 3. Add each new client invitation here as a pair.
# ==============================================================================

